                        Benedictine cathedral priory of Holy Trinity or Christ Church</orgName><p>'Liber iste est Magistri Martini de Clyve monachi ecclesie xpi
                        Cant' qui perquisiuit et eidem ecclesie dedit. . .' (fol. iiv). Martin de
                        Clyve, monk of Christ Church, first occurs in 1256 and died in 1301
                        (Greatrex, Register, 125). He was a lector who gave instruction in the
